Troubleshooting Tips
Common Issues and Solutions
Issue 1: SSH Agent Connection Failed

Cause: SSH key authentication problems
Solution: Run /tmp/fix-common-issues.sh and select option 1
Issue 2: JNLP Agent Not Connecting

Cause: Incorrect secret key or network issues
Solution: Verify secret key in Jenkins web interface and restart agent
Issue 3: Docker Agent Not Starting

Cause: Docker service issues or permission problems
Solution: Restart Docker service and check user permissions
Issue 4: Builds Not Distributing Evenly

Cause: Label restrictions or agent capacity limits
Solution: Check job label expressions and agent executor counts
Issue 5: High Resource Usage

Cause: Too many concurrent builds
Solution: Reduce executor counts or add resource limits
